  lines:
    female|a||Does drinking raise your blood pressure, and if so, by how much?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    female|a||The obvious study compares people who drink a lot with people who drink little.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 4560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:18q54q0'
    female|a||But heavy drinkers also smoke more and eat differently, and some people who never drink gave it up because they were already ill.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:owra1f'
    female|a||Each of those differences reaches blood pressure by itself, so the gap between the groups mixes drinking with everything that travels with it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:h5bjyn'
    female|a||A trial would settle it, but nobody can assign half a town to thirty years of heavy drinking.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:ce6unn'
    'female|a||The way out is an instrument: something that pushes drinking up or down for reasons that have nothing else to do with health.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:j685tc'
    female|a||Call the instrument Z, call drinking D, counted here in drinks a week, and call blood pressure Y.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1hw70us'
    'female|a||An instrument needs three things. First, Z must really move D: that is relevance.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:24xbqo'
    'female|a||Second, Z must be as good as random, so that nothing in the grey box also sets it: that is independence.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:ew47lj'
    'female|a||Third, Z may reach blood pressure only through drinking, never by a road of its own: that is the exclusion restriction.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1qddue6'
    'female|a||These are the conditions any instrument must meet. A well-known one is Oregon''s 2008 Medicaid lottery: the state drew names at random for a limited number of places, winning moved people onto coverage, and the letter itself is assumed to touch health only through the coverage it brought.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 16920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:5y0bdw'
    female|a||With all three in place, the gap in Y between the two values of Z, divided by the gap in D, is the effect of drinking for the people the instrument moved.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1c0p0w4'
    female|a||A new case. A researcher proposes "my doctor told me to cut down" as an instrument for drinking. Which condition fails?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1s94qaj'
    'female|a||Independence first: doctors advise cutting down because blood pressure is already high, so an arrow runs from health into Z. And the advice usually comes with salt, diet and medication, a road of its own, so exclusion fails too.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 16160
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    female|a||So where could we find something that sets drinking by chance, long before any illness could set it?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6440
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||Inside each of us: a gene, dealt at conception.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:149ibo0'
    female|a||The best-studied gene for drinking makes an enzyme called ALDH2, which does the second of the two steps in which your body breaks alcohol down.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9440
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    female|a||A common variant of its gene, call it A, cuts that enzyme's activity sharply, and two copies all but switch it off; the usual version we will call G.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1iyxtlx'
    'female|a||With an A on board, a toxic by-product, acetaldehyde, piles up after a drink: the face flushes, the heart races, nausea follows.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1i79a2s'
    female|a||So carriers drink less, and people with two copies drink very little; the variant is common in East Asia and rare elsewhere.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1frga5s'
    female|a||Now take a mother and a father who each carry one G and one A.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 4320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1u4b3rm'
    female|a||Each passes on one of their two copies, and which one is settled by chance when the egg or the sperm is made.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1f06ana'
    female|a||So every child of theirs lands in one of these four cells, each with probability one quarter.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:q3hnzl'
    female|a||Before the count. These parents have many children. What share of them will carry at least one A?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1tmnmpd'
    'female|a||Three in four: every cell but the top-left GG holds an A.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5360
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    female|a||Three cells of four hold an A, so three children in four will flush, and one in four will be free to drink.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8680
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    female|a||That is why an allele is closer to a lottery draw than almost anything an economist can find.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:a2rfkf'
    female|a||The draw is made at conception, before income, smoking or any illness exists, so none of them could have set it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1lec956'
    female|a||And nothing that happens later, no habit and no disease, can reach back and change which cell a child is in.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1q1a7qz'
    female|a||But the draw is fair only among the children of the same parents.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 4640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1eo10wp'
    female|a||Across a whole country, how common A is depends on whose children people are, and ancestry brings its own diets, habits and diseases.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:2vao7f'
    female|a||Keep that warning in mind; first, see what this draw lets us measure.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 4480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:r9mov8'
    female|a||Turning that draw into a number takes two comparisons and one division.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5680
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||Take a worked example with illustrative numbers: men with no A, and men who carry it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:dgmwaa'
    'female|a||The gene is our Z: zero for no A, one for carriers.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:yovoph'
    female|a||Men with no A drink fourteen drinks a week on average; carriers drink four.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:iv36kf'
    'female|a||That gap of ten drinks is the first stage: how far the gene moves drinking.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:x3w7c0'
    female|a||Their systolic blood pressures average one hundred and thirty-six and one hundred and thirty-two.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:o9gmys'
    'female|a||That gap of four points is the reduced form: how far the gene moves blood pressure.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:188n0y6'
    female|a||If the gene touches blood pressure only through drinking, all four points travelled through those ten fewer drinks.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:ib7jj8'
    female|a||So divide the gap in blood pressure by the gap in drinking.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 3800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:5itkwo'
    'female|a||Four points over ten drinks: zero point four points of blood pressure for each weekly drink.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:157q4w1'
    'female|a||Reading it as an effect needs one more condition, monotonicity: the variant must push everyone''s drinking the same way, down, which a flushing gene makes plausible.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:62btqx'
    female|a||Then the ratio is an average effect among the men whose drinking the gene moves, weighted by how far it moves them, and it is reliable in large samples rather than exact in small ones.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:7hs87h'
    female|a||Real data show the same pattern. In 2008 Chen and colleagues pooled five studies and reported blood pressure by genotype, a reduced form rather than a ratio per drink.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1idqlsn'
    female|a||In men, two G copies went with systolic pressure seven and a half points higher than two A copies, with a ninety-five percent interval from about five and a half to nine and a half.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1ksbpp6'
    'female|a||The same idea then tested a belief about drinking and stroke: from 2004 the China Kadoorie Biobank followed half a million adults for about ten years, and genotyped a hundred and sixty thousand of them for two alcohol variants, in ALDH2 and ADH1B.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 17600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:165zszk'
    female|a||Asked about their habits, men who drank moderately looked less likely to have a stroke than men who did not drink at all.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1ayibog'
    female|a||The genes showed no such dip.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 2800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:3oqak0'
    'female|a||Instead, the risk of the commonest kind of stroke rose steadily: twenty-seven percent for each extra two hundred and eighty grams a week, about four drinks a day, with an interval from thirteen to forty-three percent.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1tlwl08'
    female|a||So the gene backed the blood pressure story, and took apart the comfortable one about a protective glass a day.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:kbbjux'
    'female|a||Here is a new case, from the heart: does more of the ''good'' cholesterol, HDL, protect against heart attacks?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7160
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||Each row will be an odds ratio for a heart attack: one means no effect, and left of one means protection.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:mns2cv'
    'female|a||In ordinary data, one standard deviation more HDL went with odds about forty percent lower: an odds ratio of 0.62, with an interval from 0.58 to 0.66.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:a7q6q4'
    female|a||But people with high HDL also tend to exercise more, smoke less and weigh less, so the row could be their habits speaking.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:rt9bse'
    female|a||In 2012 Voight and colleagues put the question to the genes, with more than twenty thousand heart attack cases.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:70d6my'
    female|a||Your guess first. If HDL itself protects the heart, people whose genes raise their HDL should be protected too. What do you expect the genes showed?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:xs4u0m'
    female|a||Here is what they found, row by row.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 2720
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    female|a||One variant, in a gene called LIPG, raised HDL by enough to expect odds about thirteen percent lower.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7360
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||Its carriers had an odds ratio of 0.99, with an interval from 0.88 to 1.11: no sign of the protection expected.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:3txzr8'
    'female|a||A score built from fourteen HDL variants agreed: 0.93 per standard deviation, with an interval from 0.68 to 1.26 that straddles one.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1b29560'
    female|a||Could the method simply be blind to cholesterol? The authors ran a check where the answer was already known.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:4jyq5r'
    'female|a||For LDL, the ''bad'' cholesterol, the same approach found odds more than doubled per standard deviation, 2.13, with an interval from 1.69 to 2.69: the method sees an effect when one is there.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 15000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:8o1cq0'
    female|a||So at least some ways of raising HDL do not protect the heart, and much of the observed forty percent was probably the company HDL keeps.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1ikygh8'
    female|a||The score's interval is wide, from about a third lower to a quarter higher, so a modest benefit is not ruled out; what it does rule out, at this level of confidence, is the forty percent.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 13120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:2noxzv'
    'female|a||One caveat: genes compare lifelong differences in HDL, which is not the same as a drug that raises it in middle age.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:psusk6'
    female|a||Every failure of this design is one of the three conditions breaking, and genes break them in four well-known ways.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 8280
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||The first is pleiotropy: one gene doing two jobs, so a second road runs to blood pressure without passing through the glass; that is the exclusion restriction failing, now wearing a lab coat.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 14280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:11nsejo'
    'female|a||There is a neat check: in the Chinese study few women drink, and in women the same variants did not raise blood pressure or stroke, as a second road would have.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:kt7r0h'
    female|a||When a second road does exist, the ratio returns the true effect, beta, plus the direct effect, gamma, divided by the first stage, pi.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 9680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:n40ezu'
    'female|a||Back to the example: suppose the variant also lowered blood pressure by one point by its own road.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1f3ght2'
    female|a||Then only three of the four points came through drinking, so the truth is 0.3 per drink, yet the ratio still says 0.4; gamma is minus one and pi minus ten, so the signs cancel.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 13080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:110o174'
    female|a||Watch the first stage fall from ten drinks to one, and the estimate climb from 0.4 to 1.3.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:wk55pd'
    'female|a||Here it is done: at ten drinks the bias is a tenth of a point; at one drink it is a whole point, and the estimate reads 1.3, more than four times the truth.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12760
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||That is the second failure, a weak instrument, drawn as this thin arrow: it magnifies every small violation, and in finite samples it also pulls the estimate back toward the confounded comparison.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 13560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:ppmema'
    'female|a||Body weight shows the problem: people with two copies of the best-known obesity variant, in a gene called FTO, weigh only about three kilograms more, and it explains around one percent of the differences in body mass index.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 14200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:j615gv'
    'female|a||The third failure is linkage disequilibrium: genes are inherited in blocks, so the variant you measure travels with its neighbours on the chromosome.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10320
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:14zdbj3'
    female|a||If a neighbour acts on blood pressure itself, its effect is booked as the effect of drinking.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 5720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:qdakjq'
    'female|a||The fourth is population stratification: across a whole population, who carries a variant depends on ancestry, and ancestry also shapes diet, wealth and disease.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1vyfftj'
    female|a||Pool groups carelessly and you could discover a gene for eating with chopsticks.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 4960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:vg5ko3'
    female|a||Families raise the same worry inside one ancestry, and that is where economists now use these genes most.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 6880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:qh87bl'
    female|a||Economists now use genes as instruments for social outcomes too, such as whether body weight lowers income.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7440
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    female|a||In UK Biobank, among people of British ancestry, Tyrrell and colleagues found that a body mass index one standard deviation higher, by the genes, cut women's household income by about two thousand nine hundred pounds a year.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 14640
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1xq4fwf'
    'female|a||Ancestry is held fairly steady there, so the bigger worry is the family: parents'' genes shape the home a child grows up in, and partners with similar traits pair up.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1e9z538'
    female|a||So Brumpton and colleagues compared brothers and sisters in 2020, whose genes differ by Mendel's draw alone.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 7000
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:v2nrd7'
    female|a||Within families, the effects of body weight on diabetes and blood pressure held up; the effects of height and body weight on schooling shrank sharply.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 10560
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1dj60iw'
    female|a||Defenders of population estimates reply that theirs are far more precise, and sibling estimates noisy; whether income behaves like biology or like schooling is still open, and larger sibling samples would settle it.:
      mp3: 
      ms: 12840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:19uv3en'
    female|a||One last new case. A study in one country links heart disease to a variant that is far more common in the north, where diets also differ. Which failure is the first worry?:
      mp3: 
      ms: 11720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:c01dwx'
    'female|a||Stratification: north and south differ in ancestry and in diet, so the variant marks a region before it marks anything it does.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9800
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||So, does drinking raise blood pressure? Yes: in men, about seven points between the genotype extremes, and the genes say that is cause, not company.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12160
      voice: gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed
    'female|a||The allele makes that answer possible because it is dealt at conception, by chance, within a family: closer to a lottery than almost anything an economist can find.':
