      ms: 10160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | clear, warm economist who thinks aloud and explains with care; steady, lively pace, just a touch slower than brisk; never slow, never rushed #ctx:1br10im'
    female|a||What it cannot promise is that the gene acts only through the thing you study; independence comes almost free, exclusion must be paid for in biology.:
